                                                "sense_id": "5578e1ea-5442-38ae-b7b3-a2998fade890",
                                                "text": "In France, Mme. de Pompadour was induced by Louis XV to eat such testicles in order to break down her frigidity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "054cbb8f-e7b9-4bb4-aea4-bdaa13dc5a3e",
                                                "sense_id": "5578e1ea-5442-38ae-b7b3-a2998fade890",
                                                "text": "An epileptic lover may (slightly) experience […] sporadic impotence/frigidity."
